{"page":20127,"part":1,"text":"二毫笔  \n\n欧阳通以狸毛为笔，以兔毫覆之，此二毫笔之所由始也。以羊合兔盛于今时， 盖不但刚柔得中，差宜作字，而且价廉工省，故人所竞趋。番阳张彦实待制，名杞（元注云：犯光庙御讳）敦，尝为赋诗云：包羞不借虎皮蒙，笔阵乃推兔作锋。  未免吹毛强分别，即今同受管城封。  ","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20127,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"e5c59ef6e56b22ffd16d6282bc5fff13bc80e4b536c28b5d50df7dd41d826542","textSha256":"e5c59ef6e56b22ffd16d6282bc5fff13bc80e4b536c28b5d50df7dd41d826542","fileSha256":"e5c59ef6e56b22ffd16d6282bc5fff13bc80e4b536c28b5d50df7dd41d826542","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20127-work-117.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"负暄野录 · 二毫笔","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/jUfro2aGUdYe1C5AQUsp44","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"b0f7eadee378e351dcb137111da8be6335a094aa728a966ce669e50b6bf6ab73","id":"rEKTBKvTUgGmYEW9vAAAHh","page_id":"jUfro2aGUdYe1C5AQUsp44","root_id":"jUfro2aGUdYe1C5AQUsp44","work":"负暄野录","author":"陈槱","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":5},{"start":7,"end":133,"sourceTextSha256":"9c2f344b9cfb3c429cb4dad0dd5fb5d1ea1b6903b7d10752eeaa1a1648e5f2f0","id":"o11Hd2TPF2ThRaeqEmYVa","page_id":"jUfro2aGUdYe1C5AQUsp44","root_id":"jUfro2aGUdYe1C5AQUsp44","work":"负暄野录","author":"陈槱","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":126}]},"segments":[{"start":0,"end":5,"quote":"二毫笔  ","role":"structure","category":"篇章标题","note":"分项议题标题，实际论述在后续段落","contextStatus":"complete"},{"start":5,"end":7,"quote":"\n\n","role":"structure","category":"段落分隔","note":"展示分隔，不替代来源字符","contextStatus":"complete"},{"start":7,"end":133,"quote":"欧阳通以狸毛为笔，以兔毫覆之，此二毫笔之所由始也。以羊合兔盛于今时， 盖不但刚柔得中，差宜作字，而且价廉工省，故人所竞趋。番阳张彦实待制，名杞（元注云：犯光庙御讳）敦，尝为赋诗云：包羞不借虎皮蒙，笔阵乃推兔作锋。  未免吹毛强分别，即今同受管城封。  ","role":"theory","category":"用笔技法","note":"述二毫笔由来与羊兔配合的刚柔，兼咏笔诗","contextStatus":"com